{"ID":"20240506105105-zaogjmd","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240506105105-zaogjmd","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240506105105-zaogjmd\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240702114543-yrd7o0o\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240613131104-6ff23q8\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:1200,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240702114757-delzpum\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:4,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:4\u0026#125;","title":"316柳花（柳华、柳絮）","type":"doc","updated":"20240826145233"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240702114543-yrd7o0o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240702114543-yrd7o0o","updated":"20240826144911"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"柳絮"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/柳絮-20240702114543-div2g3j.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240826144807-85w3x5m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240826144807-85w3x5m","updated":"20240826144926"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 448px;","style":"width: 438px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"柳花"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/柳花-20240826144807-de5lsek.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 438px;\" parent-style=\"width: 448px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 788px;","style":"width: 778px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"柳花 (2)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/柳花 2-20240826144926-k9wxlst.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 778px;\" parent-style=\"width: 788px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240826145004-hrt3e0x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240826145004-hrt3e0x","updated":"20240826145038"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 631px;","style":"width: 621px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"柳花 (3)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/柳花 3-20240826145004-yte6oah.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 621px;\" parent-style=\"width: 631px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 631px;","style":"width: 621px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"柳花 (4)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/柳花 4-20240826145038-5j27q43.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 621px;\" parent-style=\"width: 631px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240826145126-1vq6owu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240826145126-1vq6owu","updated":"20240826145329"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 468px;","style":"width: 458px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"柳花 (5)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/柳花 5-20240826145126-89gig09.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 458px;\" parent-style=\"width: 468px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 395px;","style":"width: 385px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"柳花 (7)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/柳花 7-20240826145301-m19zmsf.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 385px;\" parent-style=\"width: 395px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 443px;","style":"width: 433px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"柳花 (8)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/柳花 8-20240826145329-2xkzbm1.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 433px;\" parent-style=\"width: 443px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240826145233-p3ppsss","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240826145233-p3ppsss","updated":"20240826145233"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 549px;","style":"width: 539px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"柳花 (6)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/柳花 6-20240826145219-9ve02j8.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 539px;\" parent-style=\"width: 549px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​​​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 754px;","style":"width: 744px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"柳絮3"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/柳絮3-20240702114816-jyc879e.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 744px;\" parent-style=\"width: 754px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​​​​​"}]},{"ID":"20240613131100-jbfi0iv","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240613131100-jbfi0iv"}},{"ID":"20240702114048-3k4ehxx","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240702114048-3k4ehxx","updated":"20240702114054"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"柳华《神农本草经》"}]},{"ID":"20240702114048-lo8a5m5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240702114048-lo8a5m5","updated":"20240702114048"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味苦寒。"}]},{"ID":"20240702114048-s9np141","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240702114048-s9np141","updated":"20240702114048"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"主风水黄疸，面热黑。一名柳絮。叶主马疥痂创。实主溃痈，逐脓血。子汁疗渴。生川泽。"}]},{"ID":"20240702114048-gurbz6s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240702114048-gurbz6s","updated":"20240702114048"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《名医》曰：生琅邪。"}]},{"ID":"20240702114048-6hi89ch","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240702114048-6hi89ch","updated":"20240702114048"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"案《说文》云：柳，小杨也。柽，河柳也，杨木也。《尔雅》柽，河柳。郭璞云：今河旁赤茎小杨，又旄泽柳。郭璞云：生泽中者，又杨，蒲柳。郭璞云：可以为箭，左传所谓董泽之蒲。《毛诗》云：无折我树杞。《传》云：杞木名也。陆玑云：杞，柳属也。"}]},{"ID":"20240613131100-s0o8zfd","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240613131100-s0o8zfd"}},{"ID":"20240613131302-nhugh39","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240613131302-nhugh39","updated":"20240613131306"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"柳华《新修本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240613131302-af0cnbf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613131302-af0cnbf","updated":"20240613131302"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味苦，寒，无毒。主风水，黄胆，面热黑，痂疥，恶疮，金创。一名柳絮。叶主马疥痂疮。取煎者，以洗马疥，立愈。又疗心腹内血，止痛，实主溃痈，逐脓血。子汁疗渴。生琅柳即今水杨也，花熟随风起，状如飞雪。陈元正方以为譬者，当用其未舒时，子亦随花飞，正应水渍取汁耳。柳花亦宜贴灸疮，皮叶疗漆疮耳。"}]},{"ID":"20240613131302-bttibfj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613131302-bttibfj","updated":"20240613131302"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"〔谨案〕柳与水杨全不相似。水杨叶圆阔而赤，枝条短硬；柳叶狭长，青绿，枝条长软。"}]},{"ID":"20240613131302-q8d87jl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613131302-q8d87jl","updated":"20240613131302"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"此论用柳，不载水杨。水杨亦有疗能，本草不录。树枝及木中虫屑、枝皮，味苦，寒，无毒。"}]},{"ID":"20240613131302-hjapnws","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613131302-hjapnws","updated":"20240613131302"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"主痰热淋，可为吐汤，煮洗风肿痒。酒煮含，主齿痛。木中虫屑可为浴汤，主风瘙痒瘾疹，大效。此人间柳树是也。"}]},{"ID":"20240613131302-xjr2pbh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613131302-xjr2pbh","updated":"20240613131302"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"陶云水杨非灸疮。"}]},{"ID":"20240613131100-5r1mmz4","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240613131100-5r1mmz4"}},{"ID":"20240613131247-27wcmj5","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240613131247-27wcmj5","updated":"20240613131255"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"柳华《证类本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240613131247-r2h65ec","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613131247-r2h65ec","updated":"20240613131247"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味苦，寒，无毒。主风水黄胆，面热黑，痂疥恶疮，金疮。一名柳絮。"}]},{"ID":"20240613131247-rh77js2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613131247-rh77js2","updated":"20240613131247"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"叶"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"主马疥痂疮。取煎煮以洗马疥，立愈。又疗心腹内血，止痛。"}]},{"ID":"20240613131247-z2pggfs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613131247-z2pggfs","updated":"20240613131247"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"实"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"主溃痈，逐脓血。"}]},{"ID":"20240613131247-oz2svr7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613131247-oz2svr7","updated":"20240613131247"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"子汁"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"疗渴。生琅邪川泽。"}]},{"ID":"20240613131247-uiuz7ex","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613131247-uiuz7ex","updated":"20240613131247"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"陶隐居云∶柳，即今水杨柳也。花熟，随风状如飞雪。陈元方∶以为譬，当用其未舒时。"}]},{"ID":"20240613131247-xsvwu7i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613131247-xsvwu7i","updated":"20240613131247"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"子亦随花飞，正应水渍汁尔。柳花亦宜贴灸疮。皮、叶疗漆疮。唐本注云∶柳与水杨，全不相似。水杨叶圆阔而赤，枝条短硬；柳叶狭长，青绿，枝条长软。此论用柳，不载水杨。水杨亦有疗能，本草不录。树枝及木中虫屑。枝皮味苦，寒，无毒。主痰热淋，可为吐汤。煮洗风肿痒。酒煮含，主齿痛。木中虫屑可为浴汤，主风瘙痒、瘾疹。大效。此人间柳树是也。"}]},{"ID":"20240613131247-nefm1zb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613131247-nefm1zb","updated":"20240613131247"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"陶云水杨非也。臣禹锡等谨按药性论云∶苦柳华，使。主止血，治湿痹，四肢挛急，膝痛。陈藏器云∶柳絮，《本经》以絮为花，花即初发时黄蕊。子为飞絮，以絮为花，其误甚矣。江东人通名杨柳，北人都不言杨。杨树叶短，柳树枝长。"}]},{"ID":"20240613131247-x2bghfu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613131247-x2bghfu","updated":"20240613131247"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"日华子云∶叶治天行热病，疔疮，传尸骨蒸劳，汤火疮，毒入腹热闷，服金石药人发大热闷，并下水气。煎膏，续筋骨，长肉止痛。牙痛煎含，枝煎汁可消食也。"}]},{"ID":"20240613131247-4q2eyz8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613131247-4q2eyz8","updated":"20240613131247"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"图经曰∶柳华、叶、实，生琅邪川泽，今处处有之，俗所谓杨柳者也。《本经》以絮为华。陈藏器云∶华即初发黄蕊也，子乃飞絮也。采无时。其枝皮及根亦入药。葛洪治痈疽肿毒，妒乳等多用之。韦宙《独行方》主疔疮及反花疮，并煎柳枝，叶作膏涂之。今人作浴汤、膏今人谓柳为杨柳，非也。《说文》∶杨，蒲柳也；柳，小杨也。其类非一。蒲柳其枝劲韧，可为箭 。《左传》所谓董泽之蒲，又谓之 符，即上条水杨是也。今河北沙地多生此，又生水旁，叶粗而白，木理微赤，白杞柳。"}]},{"ID":"20240613131247-fr5qkg9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613131247-fr5qkg9","updated":"20240613131247"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《郑诗》云∶无伐我树杞。陆机云∶杞，柳也，其木人以为车毂，共山淇水旁，鱼国汶水旁，纯生杞也。又，《孟子》云∶告子曰∶以人性为仁义，犹以杞柳为 是也。今人取其细条，火逼令柔韧，屈作箱箧，河朔尤多。又下有赤柽木，生河西沙地。皮赤叶细，即是今所谓柽柳者，又名春柳。《尔雅》曰∶柽，河柳。郭璞云∶今河旁赤茎小杨。陆机《诗疏》云∶皮正赤如绛，一名雨师。枝、叶似松是也。其木中脂，一名柽乳。医方∶稀用，故附于此。"}]},{"ID":"20240613131247-ph7qj78","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613131247-ph7qj78","updated":"20240613131247"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"陈藏器云∶絮主止血，治小儿一日、五日寒热，煎柳枝浴。外台秘要∶治黄胆。柳枝以水一斗，煮取浓汁半升，服令尽。肘后方∶治乳痈，二、三日种痛不瘥，但坚紫色者。用煎柳根皮法云，熬令温熨肿，一宿愈。又方∶汤火灼成疮。柳皮烧灰，以粉涂之。又方∶取柳白皮细切，以猪脂煎取汁，敷之。"}]},{"ID":"20240613131247-mjvw47z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613131247-mjvw47z","updated":"20240613131247"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"孙真人∶治牙齿疼。柳枝一握，细锉，入少盐花，浆水煎，含之甚妙。"}]},{"ID":"20240613131247-4ik2vhp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613131247-4ik2vhp","updated":"20240613131247"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"集验方∶治肿。柳枝如脚指大，长三尺，二十枚，水煮令极热，以故布裹肿处，取汤热洗之，即瘥。子母秘录∶小儿丹烦。柳叶一斤，水一斗，煮取三升，去滓，拓洗赤处，日七、八度。斗有脓不出，及痈已结聚。柳根细切熟槌，封之以帛掩，燥即易之。又方∶治耳卒风毒肿起。用柳蠹树上虫粪，以水化，取清水调白矾少许，滴入耳中，甚妙。又方∶治卒风毒肿，气急痛。以柳白皮一斤，锉，以酒煮令热，帛裹熨肿上，冷再煮易之，甚妙也。古今录验∶治齿痛。以杨柳白皮，卷如指许大，含嚼之，以汁渍痛齿根，数过即瘥也。又方∶治牙齿风龋。以柳枝锉一升，大豆一升，合炒豆炮尽，于瓷器盛之，清酒三升渍之，经三日，含之频吐。丹房镜源∶云∶柳胶结砂子。别说云∶谨按絮贴灸疮良。飞入池沼，于阴暗处为浮萍，尝以器盛水，置絮其中数日，覆之即成，又多积，可以杆作毡，以代羊毛，极柔软，宜与小儿卧，衍义曰∶柳华，《经》曰∶味苦。即是初生有黄蕊者也。及其华干，絮方∶出，又谓之柳絮。收之，贴灸疮及为茵褥。"}]},{"ID":"20240613131247-9omem7v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613131247-9omem7v","updated":"20240613131247"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"絮之下连小黑子，因风而起，得水湿处便生，如地疔之类，多不因种生出，盖亦如柳絮兼子而飞。"}]},{"ID":"20240613131247-gvrwcud","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613131247-gvrwcud","updated":"20240613131247"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"陈藏器之说是。然古人以絮为花，陶隐居亦曰∶花随风，状如飞雪。误矣。《经》中有实及子汁，诸家不解，今人亦不见用。注∶释氏谓柳为尼俱律陀木，其子极细，如人妄因极小，妄果至大，是知小黑子得因风而起。"}]},{"ID":"20240613131100-fh6t57u","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240613131100-fh6t57u"}},{"ID":"20240613131204-b4yoyu8","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240613131204-b4yoyu8","updated":"20240613131210"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"柳花《冯氏锦囊秘录》"}]},{"ID":"20240613131204-hdq9j21","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613131204-hdq9j21","updated":"20240613131204"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"柳花，贴炙疮而治湿痹挛急。根理齿痛而漱出疳涎。叶疗心腹血痛。枝治风毒瘾痒。"}]},{"ID":"20240613131100-uflvmjm","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240613131100-uflvmjm"}},{"ID":"20240613131140-cyt4m96","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240613131140-cyt4m96","updated":"20240613131159"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"柳花《本草经集注》"}]},{"ID":"20240613131140-6lw0a7j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613131140-6lw0a7j","updated":"20240613131140"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味苦，寒，无毒。主治风水，黄胆，面热黑。痂疥，恶疮，金创。一名柳絮。叶∶主马疥痂疮。取煎煮，以洗马疥，立愈。又治心腹内血，止痛。实∶主溃痈，逐脓血。子汁∶治渴。生琅琊川泽。"}]},{"ID":"20240613131140-wbp9nfe","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613131140-wbp9nfe","updated":"20240613131140"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"柳即今水杨也，花熟随风起，状如飞雪。陈元正方以为譬者，当用其未舒时，子亦随花飞，正应水渍取汁尔。柳花亦宜贴灸疮，皮叶治漆疮尔。"}]},{"ID":"20240613131100-s87o7z5","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240613131100-s87o7z5"}},{"ID":"20240613131110-6a098vo","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240613131110-6a098vo","updated":"20240613131132"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"柳花《本草崇原》"}]},{"ID":"20240613131110-to0mqab","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613131110-to0mqab","updated":"20240613131110"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"气味苦寒，无毒。主治风水、黄胆，面热黑。"}]},{"ID":"20240613131110-btkrtwl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613131110-btkrtwl","updated":"20240613131110"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（柳处处有之，有杨有柳，乃一类二种，杨叶圆阔，柳叶细长，杨枝硬而扬起，故曰杨。"}]},{"ID":"20240613131110-46qcwv0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613131110-46qcwv0","updated":"20240613131110"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"柳枝弱而垂流，故曰柳。"}]},{"ID":"20240613131110-3mgn1aw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613131110-3mgn1aw","updated":"20240613131110"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"柳有蒲柳、杞柳、柽柳之别，喜生水旁，纵横倒顺，插之皆生。春初生柔荑，即开黄蕊花，是为柳花，至春晚花中结细黑子，蕊落而絮出如白绒，因风飞舞，着于衣物能生虫蛀，入池沼即为浮萍。是为柳絮，盖黄蕊未结子时，为花结于蕊落，即为絮矣。古者春取榆柳之火。《开宝本草》有柽柳一日三起三眠，又名三眠柳。《尔雅》名河柳，即今儿医治 疹，所谓西河柳是也，乃寒凉通利，下行小便之药，用者以意会之。）"}]},{"ID":"20240613131110-s4io7rx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613131110-s4io7rx","updated":"20240613131110"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"柳性柔顺，喜生水旁，受寒水之精，感春生之气，故纵横顺逆，插之皆生。得春气，则能助肝木以平土，故主治风水，黄胆。得水精，则能清热气而资面颜，故治面热黑。"}]},{"ID":"20240613131100-gk96ik8","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240613131100-gk96ik8"}},{"ID":"20240613131101-rd8y852","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240613131101-rd8y852","updated":"20240613131101"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《中药大辞典》：柳花"}]},{"ID":"20240613131101-c0kfmrm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613131101-c0kfmrm","updated":"20240613131101"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拼音注音"}]},{"ID":"20240613131101-2uet88i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613131101-2uet88i","updated":"20240613131101"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Liǔ Huā"}]},{"ID":"20240613131101-xip54rb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613131101-xip54rb","updated":"20240613131101"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"别名"}]},{"ID":"20240613131101-dkvl6mp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613131101-dkvl6mp","updated":"20240613131101"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 杨花（《摘元方》），柳椹（《岣嵝神书》），柳蕊（《纲目拾遗》）。"}]},{"ID":"20240613131101-tqb111b","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613131101-tqb111b","updated":"20240613131101"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"出处"}]},{"ID":"20240613131101-drvwsfj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613131101-drvwsfj","updated":"20240613131101"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《本经》"}]},{"ID":"20240613131101-dihhu0e","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613131101-dihhu0e","updated":"20240613131101"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"来源"}]},{"ID":"20240613131101-tbr92g6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613131101-tbr92g6","updated":"20240613131101"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 为杨柳科植物"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"垂柳"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"的"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"花"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"}]},{"ID":"20240613131101-8br9zd1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613131101-8br9zd1","updated":"20240613131101"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性味"}]},{"ID":"20240613131101-eayij4v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613131101-eayij4v","updated":"20240613131101"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 苦，寒。"}]},{"ID":"20240613131101-zzjjho7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613131101-zzjjho7","updated":"20240613131101"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《本经》:\"味苦，寒。\""}]},{"ID":"20240613131101-06nx9mg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613131101-06nx9mg","updated":"20240613131101"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《别录》:\"无毒。\""}]},{"ID":"20240613131101-8jiplmq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613131101-8jiplmq","updated":"20240613131101"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③《滇南本草图说》:\"味甘苦淡，平。\""}]},{"ID":"20240613131101-q4j76ks","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613131101-q4j76ks","updated":"20240613131101"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"功能主治"}]},{"ID":"20240613131101-ujrornz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613131101-ujrornz","updated":"20240613131101"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 祛风，利湿，止血，散瘀。治风水，黄疸，咳血，吐血，便血，血淋，妇女经闭，齿痛。"}]},{"ID":"20240613131101-lwcw29b","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613131101-lwcw29b","updated":"20240613131101"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《本经》:\"主风水，黄疸，面热黑。\""}]},{"ID":"20240613131101-bc2jt1g","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613131101-bc2jt1g","updated":"20240613131101"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《滇南本草图说》:\"治吐血，咯血，咳血，唾血，下血，血淋，一切血症。\""}]},{"ID":"20240613131101-yju3pud","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613131101-yju3pud","updated":"20240613131101"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③《品汇精要》:\"主齿痛。\""}]},{"ID":"20240613131101-x8eszys","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613131101-x8eszys","updated":"20240613131101"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"用法用量"}]},{"ID":"20240613131101-6j59uyq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613131101-6j59uyq","updated":"20240613131101"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 内服:捣汁，或研末，1～3钱。外用:研末或烧存性撒。"}]},{"ID":"20240613131101-opza1ig","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613131101-opza1ig","updated":"20240613131101"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"复方"}]},{"ID":"20240613131101-jt930yh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613131101-jt930yh","updated":"20240613131101"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" ①治室女发热经停:柳花五、七钱，紫草一两二钱，升麻九钱，归身七钱半。上为末。每服七钱，葡萄煎汤调下。（《赤水玄珠》）"}]},{"ID":"20240613131101-vvhxlxk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613131101-vvhxlxk","updated":"20240613131101"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②治走马牙疳:杨花烧存性，入麝香少许搽。（《小儿卫生总微论方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240613131101-enm0z7k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613131101-enm0z7k","updated":"20240613131101"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"各家论述"}]},{"ID":"20240613131101-xn7a12s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613131101-xn7a12s","updated":"20240613131101"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《纲目》:\"《本经》主治风水黄疸者，柳花也。《别录》主治恶疮，金疮，溃痈，逐脓血；《药性论》止血疗痹者，柳絮及实也。花乃嫩蕊，可捣汁服，子与絮连，难以分别，惟可贴疮、止血、裹痹之用，所谓子汁疗渴者，则连絮浸渍，研汁服之尔。又崔实《四民月令》，言三月采絮愈疾，则入药多用絮也。\""}]},{"ID":"20240613131101-jopnmri","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613131101-jopnmri","updated":"20240613131101"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"摘录"}]},{"ID":"20240613131101-hlcky1r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613131101-hlcky1r","updated":"20240613131101"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《中药大辞典》"}]},{"ID":"20240613131101-h22o8qb","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240613131101-h22o8qb","updated":"20240613131101"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《中华本草》：柳花"}]},{"ID":"20240613131101-m4y26ag","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613131101-m4y26ag","updated":"20240613131101"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拼音注音"}]},{"ID":"20240613131101-q2sgcg0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613131101-q2sgcg0","updated":"20240613131101"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Liǔ Huā"}]},{"ID":"20240613131101-ngg6984","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613131101-ngg6984","updated":"20240613131101"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"别名"}]},{"ID":"20240613131101-9n19s58","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613131101-9n19s58","updated":"20240613131101"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 杨花、柳椹、柳蕊"}]},{"ID":"20240613131101-4dm8ska","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613131101-4dm8ska","updated":"20240613131101"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"出处"}]},{"ID":"20240613131101-k7hqm2e","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613131101-k7hqm2e","updated":"20240613131101"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 出自《神农本草经》。"}]},{"ID":"20240613131101-6ri8t1n","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{"Typ":1},"Properties":{"id":"20240613131101-6ri8t1n","updated":"20240613131101"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240613131101-7o7ahne","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"MS4=","Num":1},"Properties":{"id":"20240613131101-7o7ahne","updated":"20240613131101"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240613131101-cku5sbp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613131101-cku5sbp","updated":"20240613131101"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"陶弘景：柳花熟，随风起，状如飞雪。陈元正方以为痹者。当用其未舒时之子，亦随花飞，正应水渍取汁耳。"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20240613131101-m1lwthl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613131101-m1lwthl","updated":"20240613131101"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.《本草拾遗》：柳絮，《本经》以絮为花，花即初发时黄蕊，子为飞絮，以絮为花，其误甚矣。"}]},{"ID":"20240613131101-q0tdvg0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613131101-q0tdvg0","updated":"20240613131101"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.《本草衍义》：柳花即是初生有黄蕊者也。及其华干，絮方出，收之，贴灸疮，及为菌褥。絮之下，连小黑子，因风而起，得水湿处便生，如地丁之类，多不因种植，于人家庭院中自然"}]},{"ID":"20240613131101-n8ygg8l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613131101-n8ygg8l","updated":"20240613131101"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"来源"}]},{"ID":"20240613131101-g9ff9mq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613131101-g9ff9mq","updated":"20240613131101"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 药材基源：为杨柳科植物垂柳的花序。"}]},{"ID":"20240613131101-quggjz7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613131101-quggjz7","updated":"20240613131101"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拉丁植物动物矿物名：Salix babylonica L."}]},{"ID":"20240613131101-rzyuvtt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613131101-rzyuvtt","updated":"20240613131101"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"采收和储藏：春季花初开放时采收，鲜用或晒干。"}]},{"ID":"20240613131101-r3abfxj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613131101-r3abfxj","updated":"20240613131101"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生境分布"}]},{"ID":"20240613131101-n25aghn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613131101-n25aghn","updated":"20240613131101"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 生态环境：耐水湿，也能生于旱处。"}]},{"ID":"20240613131101-s25a51j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613131101-s25a51j","updated":"20240613131101"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"资源分布：分布于长江及黄河流域，其他各地均有栽培。"}]},{"ID":"20240613131101-j1nci20","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613131101-j1nci20","updated":"20240613131101"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"原形态"}]},{"ID":"20240613131101-zjbsuhl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613131101-zjbsuhl","updated":"20240613131101"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 乔木，高可达18m，树冠开展疏散。树皮灰黑色，不规则开裂；枝细，下垂，无毛。芽线形，先端急尖。叶狭披针形，长9-16cm，宽0.5-1.5cm，先端长渐尖，基部楔形，边缘具锯齿；叶柄长（3-）5-10mm，有短柔毛；托叶仅生在萌发枝上。花序先叶或与叶同时开放；雄花序长1.5-3cm，有短梗，轴有毛；雄蕊2，花药红黄色；苞片披针形，外面有毛；腺体2；雌花序长达2-5cm，有梗，基部有3-4小叶，轴有毛；子房椭圆形，无柄或近无柄，花柱短，柱头2-4深裂；苞片披针形，外面有毛；腺体有1。蒴果长3-4月，花期3-4月，果期4-5月。"}]},{"ID":"20240613131101-w8zcofx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613131101-w8zcofx","updated":"20240613131101"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性味"}]},{"ID":"20240613131101-v6dohrf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613131101-v6dohrf","updated":"20240613131101"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 苦；性寒"}]},{"ID":"20240613131101-1ozgfuw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613131101-1ozgfuw","updated":"20240613131101"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"功能主治"}]},{"ID":"20240613131101-abiych0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613131101-abiych0","updated":"20240613131101"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 祛风利湿；止血散瘀。主风水；黄疸；咳血；吐血；便血；血淋；经闭；疮疥；齿痛"}]},{"ID":"20240613131101-nga8qmb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613131101-nga8qmb","updated":"20240613131101"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"用法用量"}]},{"ID":"20240613131101-lse2buj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613131101-lse2buj","updated":"20240613131101"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 内服:煎汤，6-12g；或研末，3-6g；或捣汁。外用:适量，烧存性研末，撒。"}]},{"ID":"20240613131101-3osm3vg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613131101-3osm3vg","updated":"20240613131101"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"复方"}]},{"ID":"20240613131101-kdoim9p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613131101-kdoim9p","updated":"20240613131101"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" ①治室女发热经停：柳花五、七钱；紫草一两二钱，升麻九钱，归身七钱半。上为末。每服七钱，葡萄煎汤调下。义《赤水玄盼)②治定马牙府：扬花烧存性，入躇香少许搽。(《小儿卫生总微论方》)"}]},{"ID":"20240613131101-4x5i7zb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613131101-4x5i7zb","updated":"20240613131101"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"各家论述"}]},{"ID":"20240613131101-0ueths2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613131101-0ueths2","updated":"20240613131101"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 1.《纲目》：《本经》主治风水黄疸者，柳花也。《别录》主治恶疮，金疮，溃痈，逐脓血；《药性论》止血疗痹者，柳絮及实也。花乃嫩蕊，可捣汁服，子与絮连，难以分别，惟可贴疮、止血、裹痹之用，所谓子汁疗渴者则连絮浸渍，研汁服之尔。又崔实《四民月令》，言三月采絮愈疾，则入药多用絮也。"}]},{"ID":"20240613131101-ot5wgwj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613131101-ot5wgwj","updated":"20240613131101"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.《本经》：主风水，黄疸，面热黑。《滇南本草图说》：治吐血，咯血，咳血，唾血，下血，血淋，一切血症。"}]},{"ID":"20240613131101-bhf3vw4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613131101-bhf3vw4","updated":"20240613131101"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.《品汇精要》：主齿痛。"}]},{"ID":"20240613131101-brb05qp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613131101-brb05qp","updated":"20240613131101"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"摘录"}]},{"ID":"20240613131101-utif6uf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613131101-utif6uf","updated":"20240613131101"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《中华本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240613131103-6uuk1wl","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240613131103-6uuk1wl"}},{"ID":"20240613131104-6ff23q8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613131104-6ff23q8"}}]}